eba-id=\"143069\"><ruby>政府<rp>(</rp><rt>せいふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>物価<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶっか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>統制<rp>(</rp><rt>とうせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>解除<rp>(</rp><rt>かいじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">政府取消了价格控制。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">回送</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいそう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">转寄；改寄；转发；空驶回送；（列车）返回车站</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">階層</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいそう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">阶级；层次；阶层；层；层级结构</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76277\"><ruby>階層<rp>(</rp><rt>かいそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>対<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する、<ruby>消費社会<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうひしゃかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>論<rp>(</rp><rt>ろん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>著<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">关于阶级问题的消费社会理论。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">開拓</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいたく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">开垦；开拓；开发；开创；开辟；拓荒；开拓（新市场等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217839\">これらの<ruby>製品<rp>(</rp><rt>せいひん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たなる<ruby>販路<rp>(</rp><rt>はんろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>開拓<rp>(</rp><rt>かいたく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せねばならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们必须开启这些产品的新销售路径。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">会談</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいだん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">会谈；会议；正式讨论</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">改定</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">修订；修改；变更</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">改訂</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">修订；改订；修改</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"150474\"><ruby>時刻表<rp>(</rp><rt>じこくひょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>改訂<rp>(</rp><rt>かいてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">时间表已修改。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">街道</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいどう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">大道；主干道（尤指江户时代存在的）；（比喻）通往（成功等）的道路；途径；（中国的）街道（街